{
  "name": "TikTok Viral Video Comments & Buyer Question Miner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ TikTok Viral Video Comments & Buyer Question Miner\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nScrape thousands of TikTok comments on viral product videos to uncover raw customer objections and \"where can I buy\" leads.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/tiktok-comments-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/tiktok-comments-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify TikTok Comments Scraper - Audience Insights** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "178829ba-bda4-481e-ab92-09cc9528812d",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **TikTok Comments Scraper - Audience Insights** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "614cb646-fb07-4708-ac8d-1d606d0a43bc",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "e8dfc919-7962-44e7-aa24-37a1543a75cb",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9dfdf78b-d36c-44fd-af67-aaaceab32b61",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "bd4f11a9-654d-4a3b-a99b-3d940e5c43a5",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"where to buy ergonomic office chair\",\"best protein powder comments\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "2028a82c-ef06-4c52-a8b1-3f9b20852c92",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "e500f39d-f9b9-4f72-a3be-210fb6b1b8f3",
